      <span class="d2c-siribbon-sep">✦</span>
      <span class="d2c-siribbon-item">AAA+ SWISS ZIRCONIA & ANTI-TARNISH SEAL</span>
      <span class="d2c-siribbon-sep">✦</span>
      <span class="d2c-siribbon-item">6-MONTH WARRANTY & FREE LUXURY GIFT BOX</span>
      <span class="d2c-siribbon-sep">✦</span>
      <span class="d2c-siribbon-item">FREE CASH ON DELIVERY ACROSS 24,000+ PINCODES</span>
